WEBVTT

00:00:21.456 --> 00:00:24.328
[female voice]
Long ago, in ancient China,
很久以前，在古老的中国

00:00:24.502 --> 00:00:28.332
the Peacocks ruled
over Gongmen City.
孔雀统治着拱门城

00:00:28.506 --> 00:00:32.423
They brought great joy
and prosperity to the city,
给全城的人们带来了无尽的快乐和兴旺

00:00:32.597 --> 00:00:35.731
for they had
invented fireworks.
因为他们发明了

00:00:35.905 --> 00:00:37.907
[pops, whistling]
烟花爆竹

00:00:39.387 --> 00:00:42.172
But their son, Lord Shen,
但是他们的儿子，沈大人

00:00:42.346 --> 00:00:46.263
saw darker power
in the fireworks.
看到了爆竹里的邪恶威力

00:00:46.437 --> 00:00:49.397
What had brought
color and joy,
能带来色彩和快乐的

00:00:49.571 --> 00:00:53.923
could also bring darkness
and destruction.
也能带来黑暗和毁灭

00:00:54.097 --> 00:00:57.883
Shen's troubled parents
consulted a soothsayer.
沈大人的父母很担心，就去找了算卦大师

00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:03.541
She foretold that if Shen
continued down this dark path
她预言说如果阿沈继续在黑道上走下去

00:01:03.715 --> 00:01:09.156
he would be defeated by
a warrior of black and white.
他将被一名黑白武士击垮

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:13.116
The young lord
set out to change his fate.
富少于是受罚改变自己的命运

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:15.553
But what he did next...
但接下来他的所为将永远改变他的命运

00:01:15.727 --> 00:01:18.600
...only sealed it.
但接下来他的所为将永远改变他的命运

00:01:22.647 --> 00:01:27.174
Shen returned to his parents,
full of pride.
阿沈自豪地回到父母身边

00:01:27.348 --> 00:01:31.395
But in their faces,
he saw only horror.
但在他们脸上，他只看到了恐惧

00:01:33.136 --> 00:01:36.008
He was banished
from the city forever.
他被放逐到城外任其自生自灭

00:01:36.183 --> 00:01:39.534
But Shen swore revenge.
阿沈发誓要复仇

00:01:39.708 --> 00:01:42.450
Someday he would return,
总有一天他会回来

00:01:42.624 --> 00:01:46.410
and all of China
would bow at his feet.
让全中国给他下跪

00:01:54.679 --> 00:01:56.333
[chains clanking]

00:02:06.517 --> 00:02:07.823
[grunts]

00:02:12.958 --> 00:02:14.438
[grunts]

00:02:17.963 --> 00:02:20.792
It's almost done, Lord Shen,
but we've run out of metal.
就快要好了，沈大人，但铁用完了

00:02:22.533 --> 00:02:26.842
Search the farthest villages!
Find more metal!
搜索最远的村子！

00:02:27.016 --> 00:02:28.974
China will be mine.
中国定会是我的

00:02:39.071 --> 00:02:42.379
And then the Dragon Warrior
joined the Furious Five!
然后龙战士加入了五猛将！

00:02:42.553 --> 00:02:45.426
And they became the most
awesomest kung fu team ever!
组成了最凶猛的功夫组合！

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:47.341
Enough talk. Let's fight!
说得够多了，开打！

00:02:47.515 --> 00:02:48.429
- Yah!
- Hi-yah!
说得够多了，开打！

00:02:48.603 --> 00:02:50.431
Listen, listen.
听我说，现在就能听到龙战士在练功！

00:02:50.605 --> 00:02:52.084
You can hear
the Dragon Warrior
training right now!
听我说，现在就能听到龙战士在练功！

00:02:52.259 --> 00:02:54.174
- [Viper] 33.
- [Mantis] Stop him!
33！

00:02:54.348 --> 00:02:56.176
- It's too dangerous!
- [Tigress] 35.
拦住他！太危险了！

00:02:56.350 --> 00:02:59.527
- Stay focused!
- [Viper] 36, 37!
37！

00:02:59.701 --> 00:03:02.007
How is he doing that
with his face?
他怎么能用脸练功？

00:03:02.182 --> 00:03:04.184
[strains]

00:03:05.968 --> 00:03:08.536
[muffled] 38 bean buns!
38个豆沙包！

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:11.278
Yes! New record!
You monster!
好！新纪录！怪物啊！

00:03:11.452 --> 00:03:14.063
- Keep going! Hit 40!
- He'll never hit 40.
继续！争取吃40！ 他肯定吃不了40！

00:03:14.237 --> 00:03:16.021
[muffled] You guys wait,
we'll get to 40!
等着，肯定能到40！

00:03:16.196 --> 00:03:17.327
Do it.
加油

00:03:17.501 --> 00:03:19.373
No problem!
没问题！

00:03:19.547 --> 00:03:20.852
Yeah!

00:03:21.897 --> 00:03:23.507
Yeah!!

00:03:23.681 --> 00:03:24.639
[grunts]

00:03:24.813 --> 00:03:26.989
[muffled] Give me a minute.
给我一分钟

00:03:27.163 --> 00:03:28.773
- [laughing]
- Yeah!

00:03:28.947 --> 00:03:30.645
- Yes!
- He did it!
成功了！ 好样的，阿宝！

00:03:30.819 --> 00:03:32.516
Well done, Po!
成功了！ 好样的，阿宝！

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:35.040
- [laughter]
- Your training has paid off.
证明你的功夫练到家了

00:03:35.215 --> 00:03:37.217
- [distant gong]
- Oh, Master Shifu!
师傅！我走了，改天见！

00:03:37.391 --> 00:03:39.393
- Gotta go. See you later!
- Ooh, yeah!
师傅！我走了，改天见！

00:03:39.567 --> 00:03:41.525
You'll save those for me,
right?
你们会给我留几个，对吧？

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:45.268
[Po grunting]

00:03:48.793 --> 00:03:50.752
[grunting]

00:03:54.321 --> 00:03:56.061
[water dripping]

00:03:56.236 --> 00:03:58.934
[exhaling, inhaling]

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:03.460
Inner peace.
心静如水

00:04:03.634 --> 00:04:06.071
[exhales]
心静如水

00:04:06.246 --> 00:04:08.857
- Inner peace.
- [approaching footsteps]
心静如水

00:04:09.031 --> 00:04:10.859
- [splashing]
- [Po grunting]
心静如水

00:04:11.033 --> 00:04:14.210
[Shifu groaning] Inner peace.
心静如水

00:04:14.384 --> 00:04:16.604
Master Shifu.
师傅

00:04:16.778 --> 00:04:18.823
Master Shifu,
what do we got?
师傅，我们要跟谁打？海盗么？

00:04:18.997 --> 00:04:21.696
Pirates?
Vandals of Volcano Mountain?
破坏火焰山的？

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:26.048
Whatever it is,
I will take them down,
'cause I am in a mood.
无论是谁，
我都能把他修理得服帖，我斗志高昂

00:04:26.222 --> 00:04:29.443
I need to get something done,
you know what I mean?
我一定会办到，您明白我的意思吧？

00:04:29.617 --> 00:04:31.749
Uh, what are you doing?
你干什么？

00:04:31.923 --> 00:04:35.623
One of Master Oogway's
final teachings.
这是乌龟大师的临终教诲

00:05:03.825 --> 00:05:04.956
[gasps] Whoa!

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:07.568
[chuckles] Awesome!
厉害！怎么弄的？

00:05:07.742 --> 00:05:10.092
How did you do that?
厉害！怎么弄的？

00:05:10.266 --> 00:05:12.094
Inner peace.
心静如水

00:05:12.268 --> 00:05:15.489
Inner piece. That's cool.
心境如水？好啊

00:05:15.663 --> 00:05:17.273
Inner piece of what?
心境如啥？

00:05:17.447 --> 00:05:19.362
It is the next phase
of your training.
这是你下一步要练的功夫

00:05:19.536 --> 00:05:23.758
Every master
must find his path
每个大师都要找到自己的道路

00:05:23.932 --> 00:05:25.760
to inner peace.
以达到心静如水

00:05:25.934 --> 00:05:30.112
Some choose to meditate
for 50 years in a cave
just like this...
有的人选择在这样的洞里静坐50年

00:05:31.809 --> 00:05:34.769
...without the slightest taste
of food or water.
不沾食水

00:05:34.943 --> 00:05:36.466
[stomach grumbles]

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:38.207
Or?
或者呢？ 有人认为通过痛苦与磨难

00:05:38.381 --> 00:05:41.384
Some find it through pain
and suffering as I did.
像我这样，阿宝，你当上了龙战士那一天

00:05:41.558 --> 00:05:44.909
Po, the day you were chosen
as Dragon Warrior
像我这样，阿宝，你当上了龙战士那一天

00:05:45.083 --> 00:05:46.737
was the worst day of my life.
是我今生最凄惨的一天

00:05:46.911 --> 00:05:48.260
By far.
至今，还没有什么能与之相比

00:05:48.435 --> 00:05:50.306
Nothing else came close.
至今，还没有什么能与之相比

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:52.569
It was the worst,
most painful,
那是种痛到骨子里的痛苦时刻

00:05:52.743 --> 00:05:54.876
mind-destroying,
horrible moment...
那是种痛到骨子里的痛苦时刻

00:05:55.050 --> 00:05:57.400
- OK.
- ...I have ever experienced.
我经历过了

00:05:58.836 --> 00:06:01.361
[shivers]

00:06:01.535 --> 00:06:05.756
But once I realized
the problem was not you,
but within me,
但我一旦明白问题不在你，
而在我自己身上

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:07.541
I found inner peace,
我找到了内心的宁静就能把握宇宙的流动

00:06:07.715 --> 00:06:11.371
and was able to harness
the flow of the universe.
我找到了内心的宁静就能把握宇宙的流动

00:06:11.545 --> 00:06:14.069
So that's it?
I just need inner peace?
就这样？我只需要内心的平静？

00:06:14.243 --> 00:06:16.332
My innards are already
super, super peaceful,
我的内脏已经相当平静了

00:06:16.506 --> 00:06:20.031
so all I need to do
is just get this thing going.
我只要把这件事办好就行了

00:06:20.205 --> 00:06:22.077
Inner peace,
you're going down.
心静如水，流下去吧

00:06:22.251 --> 00:06:23.992
Now show me what you were
doing there with your feet.
给我看你用脚做啥，脚底板功

00:06:24.166 --> 00:06:25.385
I saw you do sort of
a fancy foot...
给我看你用脚做啥，脚底板功

00:06:25.559 --> 00:06:25.565
Po! Bandits!

